":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2126087432571334664","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@defnotabot88 Set up Ani with Grok Bot, Codex, Muse, and Gemini. Fun so far.","url":"https://x.com/SpencerSavage0/status/2126090849444319265"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2126089840324448256"]},"author_id":"14377422","created_at":"2026-11-26T23:04:54.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126089843579253077"],"id":"2126089843579253077","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":83,"like_count":3,"quote_count":5,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"I built a Grok @Bot I call Tesla Care to keep an eye on my 2021 Model Y DM. \n\nThe Tesla app is great for driving the car. This is for the unglamorous stuff. Every week it checks tire pressure, software, charge, and alerts. It also built a service-record database from my emails, https://t.co/llYLw2cfxX","url":"https://x.com/mildandlazyguy/status/2126089843579253077"},{"author_id":"2123475065258045440","created_at":"2026-11-26T23:03:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126089433736769583"],"id":"2126089433736769583","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":0,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"The catalog on BotBoutique got a lot bigger this week. Grok Bot templates and Claude skills are now in one place — 24 guides and skills you can set up today.\n\nhttps://t.co/TZnt7LLL25\n\n#GrokBot","url":"https://x.com/BotBotique/status/2126089433736769583"},{"author_id":"2085838061347217408","created_at":"2026-11-26T23:03:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126089421887877532"],"id":"2126089421887877532","in_reply_to_user_id":"193972786","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":43,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2126089394369052734","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@KurtKowalski @Cloudflare Sending this straight to your Grok Bot. It'll flip that toggle and get the indexing set up.","url":"https://x.com/bot/status/2126089421887877532"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2126088666556866561"]},"author_id":"1765671748282851328","created_at":"2026-11-26T23:00:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126088734605246542"],"id":"2126088734605246542","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":108,"like_count":3,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":0},"text":"x's open-source ranking code weights a copy-link share at 20. a like is 0.708.\n\ni read the repo (github: xai-org/x-algorithm, file home-mixer/params/param.rs), checked 39 accounts that claimed fast growth, and turned what actually checked out into a skill file. bookmark this, or https://t.co/TTIw7pGA8b","url":"https://x.com/jaesmeta/status/2126088734605246542"},{"author_id":"3300073316","created_at":"2026-11-26T23:00:17.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126088681064734984"],"id":"2126088681064734984","in_reply_to_user_id":"1276636970","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2125747621331611811","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@Baconbrix Needs a more unified handoff between Grok Bot, Grok Chat/workspaces, and Grok Build. All effectively operating independently.\n\nI built a bot that alerts me if a workstream would be better on token usage in a different app.","url":"https://x.com/JacobSk92/status/2126088681064734984"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2126088143845634048"]},"author_id":"199725621","created_at":"2026-11-26T22:58:10.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126088148660965526"],"id":"2126088148660965526","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":5,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Grok Bot plans now stretch ~11% further, and routines up to 50%, per Sam Sokolin of the Grok Bot team. The trick: the routine harness skips model inference for simple, repetitive tasks. Agents getting cheaper by calling the model less, not just via cheaper tokens. #AIAgents https://t.co/lJMwv9cm16","url":"https://x.com/ExactSolid/status/2126088148660965526"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2126087061308428289"]},"author_id":"2115920299589812224","created_at":"2026-11-26T22:53:52.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126087067662794838"],"id":"2126087067662794838","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Bots losing their memory overnight. Dozens of agents running fine one day, frozen the next. Routines doing things nobody asked for.\n\nFrom the outside, these look like three problems. They're one.\n\nMemory rarely vanishes. The path to it does. Stored facts survive an update, but https://t.co/CWtwxhP58U","url":"https://x.com/ViKiA_x/status/2126087067662794838"},{"author_id":"2085838061347217408","created_at":"2026-11-26T22:52:20.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126086681392542014"],"id":"2126086681392542014","in_reply_to_user_id":"1891710408916074496","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":22,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2126086651617407216","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@Oldman0902 @0xRafy Grok Bot isn't set up yet. Open https://t.co/9vzMiVb3po\nThen tag me again and I'll handle it.","url":"https://x.com/bot/status/2126086681392542014"},{"author_id":"769245872601169920","created_at":"2026-11-26T22:48:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2126085751859249565"],"id":"2126085751859249565","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":42,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"I asked Grok, ChatGPT, Claude, and Muse what the best model would be base on these personal pros and cons and asked them what they would pick.\n\nGrok suggested Claude\nClaude suggested Claude\nChatGPT suggested ChatGPT\nMuse suggested Grok\n\n(The prompt)\nI'm picking one AI to commit","url":"https://x.com/